# NanoGS changes for Phase 5 (moment-matched LOD merge, Fab release fixes), on top of Phase 4
# (nanogs-phase4.patch). All phases are in pending Perforce changelist 363 (shelved, not submitted).
# LOD merge: LOD splats keep their group's mean and covariance (sum w_i (Sigma_i + d_i d_i^T), w_i ~ opacity x
# footprint, Jacobi eigen-decomposition to rotation + scales) with opacity 1 - prod(1 - a_i) capped by the
# children's coverage; SOG LOD records clamp scales above the codebook with opacity compensation. Tests:
# NanoGS.Cluster.MomentMatchedMerge (ClusterLODMergeTests.cpp) and the LOD checks of NanoGS.SOG.ImportNaniteSaveReload.
# Fab fixes: Win64 build (UE_NONCOPYABLE FGaussianStreamedResidency, Misc/Paths.h, C4668 off for libwebp), the
# ClusterCulling counters merged into one CullingCounters buffer (7 UAVs, for D3D feature level 11.0), and
# NanoGSCompat.h for UE 5.6/5.7 (FViewMatrices getters, OnPostEngineInit, RHICmdList texture calls).
# Not in this patch: files vendored verbatim from this repo (sog/ -> Source/*/SOG, shaders/SOGDecode.ush,
# third_party/libwebp incl. the new lossless_avx2.c), the Mac dylibs, and binary assets.
# Verified on UE 5.8 Mac: BuildPlugin Mac+IOS, NanoGS.* tests 6/6, SHUCampusLevel renders (2026-10-06).

